claim: options = [[client+4]+4], mode byte +0x6d, set by 0x61b6f0 (plan L76)
referent: 0x5ed700 `8b4104 8b4004 c3`; 0x61b6f0 `mov [ecx+0x6d],al` (also writes +0x6e when al is 0 or 1)
