referent: 0x463556 `mov [edx+0x7fbaf8],al`; 0x70acaf calls the per-char locale conversion 0x6fb69e on both strings; 0x4635c9 push 0x73e2e4 ("%f")
checked: disasm
verdict: holds (agree)
